^\s*(rm|mv|cp|dd|tee|chmod|chown|chgrp|kill|pkill|killall|sudo|su|shutdown|reboot|poweroff|halt|mount|umount|systemctl|useradd|userdel|usermod|passwd|mkfs|fdisk|parted|wipefs)\b
